        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International CP-3718, Fancy Ribbed Cabinet Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nWe love this pull for its sophisticated styling. The Fancy Cabinet Pull made by RK International features a very classy lined design that adds interest to its elongated shape. It is available in three sizes: 5 inches c.c., 8 inches c.c., 12 inches c.c. Choose any of the 5 available finishes for a truly beautiful finishing touch to your cabinets.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching: <a href=\"/products/fancy-ridged-cabinet-knob-rk-international-ck-9308\"><b>Fancy Ridged Cabinet Knob</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/fancy-ridged-drop-pull-rk-international-cp-3721\"><b>Fancy Ridged Drop Pull</b></a>, and <a href=\"/products/fancy-ribbed-appliance-pull-rk-international-ap-ph-4718\"><b>12 Inch Fancy Ridged Door Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the RK International CP-3718 Indian Drum Vertical Cabinet Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Screw: 1\" long #8 - 32 machine screw.</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with all necessary installation hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 3 sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>RKI-CP-3718</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 5\"</li>\r\n<li>Length Overall: 5-7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-5/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>RKI-CP-3719</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Length Overall: 8-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-5/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>RKI-CP-3720</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Length Overall: 12-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-5/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MUL-T-LOCK-G55G1_size.gif?v=1704354738\" width=\"600\" height=\"146\" border=\"0\" alt=\"RKI Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
